{"unit_id":"jacksong-sourse__dsh-world-engine#feature-world-rules","repo":"jacksong-sourse/dsh-world-engine","commit":"24992edd5115bd2f2e07a8642d3efbf84b0d1d43","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-world-engine 的功能「world-rules」：把自然语言世界描述归纳为差异、稀缺、利害、基线、交互和时间六类声明式规则；用户描述世界后触发，形成供场景运行使用的规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:13-23"]}
{"unit_id":"jacksong-sourse__dsh-world-engine#feature-scene-orchestration","repo":"jacksong-sourse/dsh-world-engine","commit":"24992edd5115bd2f2e07a8642d3efbf84b0d1d43","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-world-engine 的功能「scene-orchestration」：依世界规则启动多智能体场景，并把规则与各智能体的位置交给 world-agent 技能；适合推演主体间交互，输出到达自然节点时的运行记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:22-23"]}
{"unit_id":"jacksong-sourse__dsh-world-engine#feature-agent-guidance","repo":"jacksong-sourse/dsh-world-engine","commit":"24992edd5115bd2f2e07a8642d3efbf84b0d1d43","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-world-engine 的功能「agent-guidance」：world-agent 指导模拟中的智能体从规则理解自身处境，在允许范围内行动，并回应世界变化及其他智能体；输入由启动流程提供的规则和位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["world-agent.md:8-14"]}
{"unit_id":"jacksong-sourse__dsh-world-engine#feature-event-record","repo":"jacksong-sourse/dsh-world-engine","commit":"24992edd5115bd2f2e07a8642d3efbf84b0d1d43","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-world-engine 的功能「event-record」：场景到达一轮、历史片段或事件等自然节点后，world-engine 要求输出只记录发生事项的运行记录，不评价智能体是否真实产生情感。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:22-23"]}
